      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Five destinations; mobile uses an icon above every label in an equal-column grid.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Workspace\"><button aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/></svg><span>Agents</span></button><button><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Overview</span></button><button><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8zM14 2v6h6\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"13\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"m13 15 2 2\"/></svg><span>Findings</span></button><button><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3\"/></svg><span>Evidence</span></button><button><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 6h8a4 4 0 0 1 0 8H7a4 4 0 0 0 0 8h8\"/></svg><span>Roadmap</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;max-width:196px;padding:12px;background:#11130f}.ds-nav button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;border:0;background:transparent;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;font:13px var(--font-public,'Public Sans'),sans-serif;color:#a9aca3;cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s}.ds-nav button:hover{color:var(--ink,#f1f1eb);background:#22261e}.ds-nav button[aria-current=page]{background:#2c3423;color:#d2f39d}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#c7ef79);outline-offset:4px}.ds-nav svg{flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));max-width:none;gap:2px}.ds-nav button{min-width:0;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding:10px 1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;font-size:9px}.ds-nav svg{width:15px;height:15px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav button{transition:none}}"
